// Package gen holds WinRT bindings for the Bluetooth LE APIs the winrt backend uses, generated by winrt-go-gen
// from the Windows metadata it embeds. Upstream github.com/saltosystems/winrt-go ships a subset of these classes
// without attribute handles, descriptors, raw advertisement data or pairing, so they are generated here with
// the methods btproxy needs; foundation, collections and streams still come from upstream.
//
// Regenerate with `go generate ./internal/ble/winrt/gen` (any OS; the output is windows-only). fiximports.go
// moves the output under windows/ here and points its imports at these packages.
package gen

//go:generate go run fiximports.go -clean

